    "stem": "Multiply. \\(\\sqrt{2}\\left(\\sqrt{8}+\\sqrt{18}\\right)\\)",
    "solution": "\\(\\sqrt{2}\\left(\\sqrt{8}+\\sqrt{18}\\right)\\)\n\\(=\\sqrt{2 \\times 8}+\\sqrt{2 \\times 18}\\)\n\\(=\\sqrt{16}+\\sqrt{36}\\)\n\\(=4+6\\)\n\\(=10\\)"
