    "subtopic": "Operations on Quadratic Surds",
    "difficulty": "MODERATE",
    "stem": "Multiply. \\(\\left(\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{2}\\right)\\left(2\\sqrt{3}-3\\sqrt{2}\\right)\\)",
    "solution": "\\(\\left(\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{2}\\right)\\left(2\\sqrt{3}-3\\sqrt{2}\\right)\\)\n\\(=\\sqrt{3}\\left(2\\sqrt{3}-3\\sqrt{2}\\right)-\\sqrt{2}\\left(2\\sqrt{3}-3\\sqrt{2}\\right)\\)\n\\(=\\sqrt{3} \\times 2\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{3} \\times 3\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{2} \\times 2\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{2} \\times 3\\sqrt{2}\\)\n\\(=2 \\times 3-3\\sqrt{6}-2\\sqrt{6}+3 \\times 2\\)\n\\(=6-5\\sqrt{6}+6\\)\n\\(=12-5\\sqrt{6}\\)"
  },
